{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この子、自分に似てる気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねこのようなリスのような"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなく2枚撮っちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上目遣いﾊﾞｰｼﾞｮﾝ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこれ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、中学の頃からのお友達と3人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の遊園地に行ったんだけどね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのときにお友達がゲームで取って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にくれたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宝物にします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お守り( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし、心が泣きそうになったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この子を見て笑おう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ、今は女子大生とかOLさんになってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいなあ～って思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張らなきゃなっ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は会えなかったけど、乃木坂工事中を見たお友達からも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「おめでとう」って連絡が来たりしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなにより、ファンの皆さんから沢山のコメントが届きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの喜びが何よりもの幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は弱い人間で才能とかもないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の縁だけには、恵まれてると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命と同じくらい大切な人たちが、私には沢山います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えてくれる人のおかげで、井上小百合が存在できているから。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が嬉しいって思ったことも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方や、家族や、友達のほうが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分なんかより沢山喜んでくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな人たちを傷付けたくないから、毎日を、本気で必死で頑張らせていただいています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに12枚目は、1年間の色んな経験や、色んなご恩を、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に無駄にしないように、本当に頑張らなきゃなって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前が呼ばれたとき、すごくすごく有難かったです。嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ正直、自分だけが頑張ってた訳ではないし、みんな本当に頑張っていたから、複雑な気持ちになっちゃったりして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉がまとまらず、ブログを書くのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がかかってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、選ばれたからには、悔しい思いをした子の分まで、ここで自分が頑張らなきゃ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに申し訳がないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「この子がここに居てくれて良かった」って力になれるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯頑張らせていただきます！(>_<｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、1年間ずっと、アンダーとして頑張ってきたその全てが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この12枚目に、かかっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今しかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のステップに進まなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからが勝負だ(>_<)って感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"育んだつぼみは、皆さんと一緒に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと、「選抜で」咲かせたいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目指せ、ファン孝行。！(﹡ˆˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、乃木坂46をもっと沢山の方に「素敵なグループだな～」って知ってもらえるよう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆらしさを活かして、様々な面で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループに貢献できるよう頑張りたいとも思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくにこれから、6月7月と、舞台を2つやらせて頂くので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の好きなお芝居を通して、乃木坂の良さを知っていただけたら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、夏のツアーは、全体での久々の大きな規模のライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人のパフォーマンスレベルを上げて、少しでもグループの底上げができるように務めます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって、みんなの存在は必要不可欠です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも有難う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も必要な存在になりたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私だけど、ちゃんとみんなの役に立ちたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期の頃は、その場所にいても、何をしていいかわかりませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、生駒ちゃんがセンターに戻ったり、かずみんが福神に戻ったり、自分もデビュー曲と全く同じ位置で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し当時を思い出します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの頃は、自分の不甲斐なさに悔しくて泣いてばかりの子供だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう大人になったので、しっかり前を見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の弱さも見つめて、笑顔で頑張っていきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんの気持ち、全てわかる訳じゃないけど、今ならあの頃より理解できます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビュー当時に一人で背負ってたもの、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は後ろでしっかり支えるから、安心して夏らしく思い切り楽しんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センターやってほしいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、純粋に、自分は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このお仕事が好きなんだなあ～って思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日がキラキラしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんと会えて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルになって、良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、側に居てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s.   ゆったんの喉が早く治りますように..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/12/9655463/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}